B.awx=new A.dG('This Privacy Policy explains how [Company Legal Name] ("ChatAndTip," "we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, discloses, and protects information when you use our mobile application and our website chatandtip.com (collectively, the "Platform"). By using the Platform, you agree to the collection and use of information as described in this Policy.')
B.avP=new A.fe("1. Information We Collect")
B.awr=new A.dG("We collect the following categories of information:")
B.auW=new A.cp("Account information: name, username, email address, date of birth, password, languages spoken, and profile details you provide. Note that a User's or Creator's date of birth, email address, passwords, and location are not displayed publicly on the Platform.")
B.auh=new A.cp("Identity and payout verification information: government-issued ID (front and back) and a verification selfie, collected from Creators to confirm age and identity and, prior to any payout, to verify eligibility to receive funds. This data is not stored on our servers; it is specifically used to verify identity.")
B.av7=new A.cp("Entity Account information: for accounts registered on behalf of a business, organization, government body, or other entity, we collect the legal business/organization name, username, country of origin, physical address, official phone number, official email address, a short business description, and an optional website link. The physical address, official phone number, and official email address are not displayed on the public profile.")
B.auD=new A.cp("Entity verification documents: to publish and verify an Entity Account, we collect an owner's or representative's government-issued ID or passport together with a registration certificate, Operating License, Commercial Registry Extract, or Official Letter from an Agency, and one further supporting document such as tax registration records, a utility bill, a bank statement, a trust deed, proof of charitable status, business registration service records, or a Memorandum and Articles of Association.")
B.av1=new A.cp("Payment information: billing and mobile-money details (including M-PESA) processed by our third-party payment processors in-app and on chatandtip.com. We do not store full payment card numbers on our own servers.")
B.aut=new A.cp("Content: photos, videos, reels, captions, descriptions, hashtags, tags, comments, and other material you upload or post through the Platform.")
B.aur=new A.cp("Messaging and Session data: metadata about direct messages, VoiceCall Sessions, and VideoCall Sessions, such as timestamps, duration, scheduling requests, approvals, no-shows, and strikes. We do not routinely record call audio or video content, except as described in Section 5.")
B.auS=new A.cp("Transaction and Wallet data: purchases of Access Keys, ChatCredits, VoiceCall Sessions, and VideoCall Sessions; Tips (Pebbles, Gems, Diamonds) sent or received; Wallet balances; and payout history. For Entity Accounts, this also includes Business Plan or Premium Plan subscription purchases, billing cycle (monthly or annual), plan upgrades or downgrades, and Ad purchases.")
B.ava=new A.cp("Device and usage data: IP address, device identifiers, browser type, operating system, log data, and analytics about how you interact with the Platform, including notifications, likes, shares, views, and comments.")
B.auv=new A.cp("Location data: approximate location derived from your IP address, used for security, fraud prevention, currency localization, and legal compliance -- not displayed to other Users.")
