B.avN=new A.fe("2. How We Use Information")
B.awG=new A.dG("We use the information we collect to:")
B.auz=new A.cp("Create and manage your account and verify your identity and age.")
B.auX=new A.cp("Operate core features, including messaging (Access Keys/ChatCredits), VoiceCall and VideoCall Session scheduling, reels and Content delivery, comments, and the Tipping system.")
B.auV=new A.cp("Process purchases of Virtual Currency, manage Wallet balances, and issue Creator payouts, including verifying identity documents before releasing funds.")
B.avl=new A.cp("Review and verify Entity Account registration and publishing documents, issue verification badges (blue, grey, or gold), and process Business Plan and Premium Plan subscriptions and Ad purchases.")
B.avn=new A.cp("Maintain the safety and integrity of the Platform, including detecting fraud, abuse, excessive tipping patterns that trigger manual verification, and violations of our Terms and Community Guidelines (including nudity policy violations reported during Sessions).")
B.auK=new A.cp("Administer the no-show and strike system for Sessions, including issuing notifications, fines, refunds, and account restrictions.")
B.auO=new A.cp("Communicate with you about your account, bookings, transactions, and updates to our policies.")
B.auP=new A.cp("Personalize content recommendations (such as trending reels and subject/language filters) and improve Platform features.")
B.auR=new A.cp("Comply with legal obligations, including tax reporting for Creator earnings, anti-money-laundering checks, and responses to lawful requests from authorities.")
