B.avU=new A.fe("1. Eligibility and Nature of the Platform")
B.awj=new A.dG("You must be at least 18 years old to create an account or use the Platform in any capacity, whether as a User or a Creator. By using the Platform, you represent and warrant that you are 18 years of age or older, that you have the legal capacity to enter into these Terms, and that all registration information you submit is accurate and truthful. We may require age or identity verification at any time, including government-issued identification and a live selfie, and may suspend or terminate accounts where verification cannot be confirmed.")
B.awH=new A.dG("ChatAndTip is a content and creator-engagement platform and does not display personal information of the users or the creators. Specifically, profiles only display information such as date joined, languages spoken, and content posted.")
B.awS=new A.dG("When signing up, a person registers either an Individual account or an Entity Account on behalf of a business, organization, government body, or other entity. Individual account registration proceeds as described elsewhere in these Terms; Entity Account registration, publishing, verification, and plans are governed by Section 5.")
B.avL=new A.fe("2. Definitions")
B.av_=new A.cp('"User" means any person who registers to view content, follow Creators, send messages, or spend Access Keys, ChatCredits, Sessions, or Tips.')
