B.avc=new A.cp('"Content" means any photo, video (including reels), audio, text, caption, comment, or other material uploaded, transmitted, or displayed on the Platform.')
B.auw=new A.cp('"Access Key" ("Key") is a virtual item purchased by a User and spent to unlock a Creator\'s reply to the User\'s first ("IceBreaker") message in a conversation.')
B.avg=new A.cp('"ChatCredit" is a virtual item purchased by a User and spent each time a Creator replies to a subsequent message after the initial IceBreaker exchange.')
B.auu=new A.cp('"VoiceCall Session" and "VideoCall Session" (together, "Sessions") are virtual items purchased by a User, each representing a 15-minute scheduled call with a Creator.')
B.auJ=new A.cp('"Tip" means a voluntary payment made by a User directly to a Creator using a Pebble, Gem, or Diamond.')
B.auo=new A.cp('"Virtual Currency" refers collectively to Access Keys, ChatCredits, Sessions, and Tips.')
B.auZ=new A.cp('"Wallet" means the financial account associated with your profile, on which all purchases, balances, and payouts are managed exclusively in-app and on chatandtip.com.')
