B.avD=new A.fe("3. Account Registration")
B.awt=new A.dG("You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and for all activity that occurs under your account. You must notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of your account. We reserve the right to refuse registration, suspend, or terminate any account at our discretion, including where we believe these Terms have been violated. Registering, browsing, following Creators, commenting, and replying to comments do not require any Virtual Currency balance; only direct messages beyond the free reply threshold described in Section 8, and Sessions, require a balance.")
B.aw7=new A.fe("4. Creator Accounts and Content")
B.awA=new A.dG("Creators may upload Content, communicate with Users via direct message, and host VoiceCall and VideoCall Sessions. Creator's interactions on the platform are subject to review, including identity and age verification. We may reject, suspend, or revoke an account at any time for violation of these Terms, our Community Guidelines, or applicable law.")
B.awl=new A.dG("Creators retain ownership of the Content they upload, subject to the license granted to us in Section 13. Creators are solely responsible for ensuring that all Content complies with these Terms, our Community Guidelines, and all applicable laws, and that they hold all necessary rights, consents, and releases (including from any other individuals appearing in the Content) to upload and distribute it. When uploading reels or images, Creators may add a title/caption and description, and may choose where the title/caption is displayed; descriptions may include hashtags, links, and tags of other users.")
B.avI=new A.fe("5. Entity Accounts")
B.awT=new A.dG('The sign-up process supports two distinct paths. Upon choosing to sign up, a person selects whether the account is an Individual account or an Entity account, meaning an account registered on behalf of a business, organization, government body, or other entity ("Entity Account"). If Individual is selected, registration proceeds as described in Section 3. If an Entity Account is selected, registration instead follows this Section 5.')
B.ax5=new A.pv("5.1 Entity Account Registration")
B.awa=new A.dG("Entity Account registration requires the following, in place of the standard registration flow:")
B.av2=new A.cp('Basic Info: the full business/organization name as captured in official/legal documents; a username; country of origin; physical address; and an official phone number and email address. Once set and the account is operational, changing the registered name requires new verification; attempting to change it displays the message, "Please note changing the name will require new verification."')
B.auC=new A.cp("About: a short description of the business, and an optional link to the entity's website.")
B.aun=new A.cp("The physical address, official phone number, and official email address are not displayed on the public profile.")
B.aux=new A.cp("Publishing: the account holder must submit, for verification, (a) the ID or passport of an owner or representative, together with a registration certificate, an Operating License, a Commercial Registry Extract, or an Official Letter from an Agency; and (b) one further supporting document from among: Company TIN or Tax Registration records, a Utility Bill, a Bank Statement, a Trust Deed, Proof of Charitable Status, Business Registration Service records, or Memorandum and Articles of Association.")
B.aJK=s([B.av2,B.auC,B.aun,B.aux],t.DV)
B.avt=new A.no(B.aJK)
B.awW=new A.dG("Verification of submitted documents can take up to 10 business days. Upon successful verification, an Entity Account receives a badge (blue, grey, or gold) and the account is published.")
B.ax3=new A.pv("5.2 Entity Account Plans")
B.awB=new A.dG('Once published, an Entity Account has access to a "Purchase Plan" option. Purchasing a plan is required before the account can reply to direct messages or be approved for callback requests; a published Entity Account will still receive direct messages and callback requests before subscribing, or after a subscription lapses, but cannot act on them until a plan is purchased. Attempting to reply to a direct message or approve a callback request while unsubscribed prompts the account to purchase a plan. Entity Accounts may subscribe monthly or annually, and may upgrade or downgrade their plan at any time.')
B.aus=new A.cp("Business Plan -- Monthly $35 / Yearly $390: reply to up to 70 direct messages daily, and be requested for up to 20 VoiceCall and VideoCall Sessions combined per day.")
B.auc=new A.cp("Premium Plan -- Monthly $45 / Yearly $510: reply to unlimited direct messages daily and be booked for unlimited Sessions; includes one free Ad per month.")
B.aMd=s([B.aus,B.auc],t.DV)
B.avq=new A.no(B.aMd)
B.ax1=new A.pv("5.3 Properties and Limitations of Entity Accounts")
B.auj=new A.cp("A Entity Account cannot earn Tips, ChatCredits, or payment for VoiceCall or VideoCall Sessions, and does not display the tip icon in its chatbox.")
B.av6=new A.cp("A Entity Account cannot top up a Wallet balance; it may only pay for the plans described in Section 5.2.")
B.aui=new A.cp("A Entity Account may only reply to direct messages sent to it and cannot initiate direct messages to other Users; it cannot book calls and can only be requested for a callback.")
B.auI=new A.cp("A Entity Account does not receive strikes or fines.")
B.auQ=new A.cp("A Entity Account has a history of activity reflecting subscription and Ad transactions.")
B.auy=new A.cp("A Entity Account cannot be deleted or deactivated by its holder, and cannot hide or delete comments, though it may write and pin comments. A holder who needs to deactivate or delete an Entity Account must contact support.")
B.aL0=s([B.auj,B.av6,B.aui,B.auI,B.auQ,B.auy],t.DV)
B.avv=new A.no(B.aL0)
B.ax2=new A.pv("5.4 Messaging with Entity Accounts")
B.awE=new A.dG('When a User sends a direct message to an Entity Account, the "Start chatting" prompt in the chatbox displays the disclaimer, "Messaging and calling this account is free."')
B.awK=new A.dG('A User\'s chatbox, when interacting with an Entity Account, includes an "End Chat" button. Ending the chat notifies the Entity Account, which cannot send further messages to that User; the conversation can only resume once the User sends a new message to the Entity Account.')
B.awY=new A.pv("5.5 Adding and Switching Accounts")
B.awh=new A.dG('An "Add Account" option is available on both Individual and Entity Accounts, allowing a User who is already logged in to sign in to, or sign up for, an additional Individual or Entity Account. Once added, a User may switch between any of their added accounts while logged in.')
B.avF=new A.fe("6. Prohibited Content and Conduct")
B.awF=new A.dG("The following are strictly prohibited on the Platform, and violations may result in immediate account termination, forfeiture of unpaid balances, and reporting to law enforcement where required by law:")
B.auE=new A.cp("Content involving anyone under the age of 18, including content that appears to depict a minor or is presented as depicting a minor.")
B.auL=new A.cp("Non-consensual content, including content shared without the depicted individual's consent, and non-consensual intimate imagery.")
B.aum=new A.cp("Nudity or sexually explicit conduct during Sessions or in direct messages, or any Content that violates our Community Guidelines on nudity and explicit material.")
B.auT=new A.cp("Content involving violence, exploitation, human trafficking, or coercion.")
B.av9=new A.cp("Content that infringes another party's intellectual property or privacy rights.")
B.avm=new A.cp("Harassment, hate speech, threats, or discriminatory conduct directed at other Users or Creators.")
B.auU=new A.cp("Solicitation of illegal goods or services, or facilitation of illegal activity.")
B.av3=new A.cp("Attempts to circumvent the Platform's payment system, age verification, tipping limits, or moderation systems.")
B.aud=new A.cp("Impersonation of another person or entity, or providing false identity or age information.")
B.avj=new A.cp("Sharing personal contact information for the purpose of moving transactions off-Platform to avoid fees.")
