B.awX=new A.dG("Virtual Currency has no cash value outside the Platform and cannot be redeemed, transferred, sold, or exchanged for real currency by Users. We are not a financial institution, and Virtual Currency is not a deposit, security, or investment.")
B.aw0=new A.fe("10. Creator Payouts")
B.avk=new A.cp('Amounts earned by a Creator from Access Keys, ChatCredits, VoiceCall Sessions, and VideoCall Sessions become part of the Creator\'s Available Balance (withdrawable) 30 days after being earned, once the earning has "matured."')
B.auY=new A.cp("A Creator's Current Balance includes their Available Balance plus amounts already earned but not yet matured for withdrawal.")
B.aup=new A.cp("Total Earned reflects the cumulative value of all payouts made to the Creator.")
B.aue=new A.cp("Lateness fines under Section 8.3 are deducted automatically from the Creator's Available Balance.")
B.auB=new A.cp("The minimum payout is $40 (or the local-currency equivalent, which may be adjusted by region).")
B.auH=new A.cp("The payment requests must made by 20th of every month. Payouts are expected within reflect within 5-7 business days.")
B.auF=new A.cp("The accumulated fines are deducted from the matured earnings before payouts are made.")
B.av4=new A.cp("Before receiving any payout, a Creator must upload a valid government-issued ID (front and back) and a verification selfie.")
