B.awk=new A.dG('Session values placed "Under Review" under Section 8.4 are held pending investigation and are not included in Available Balance until the review is resolved. Payouts are subject to identity and tax verification and may be delayed or withheld to investigate suspected fraud, chargebacks, or violations of these Terms.')
B.aw_=new A.fe("11. The Wallet and Payments")
